How they all work together

index.js → starts the app and renders <App />.
App.js → decides the layout: <Nav /> on the side, <Header /> on top, <Main /> in center.
Nav.js → sidebar menu, changes state in App to switch pages.
Main.js → shows the content based on current page state.
Header.js → top bar, static info like app title or user info.


