Deploy on Vercel

    Go to Vercel
    and log in (GitHub login is easiest).
    Click “New Project” → Import Git Repository → select your repo.
    Vercel will detect it’s a React project and automatically set:
    Framework Preset: Create React App
    Build Command: npm run build
    Output Directory: build
    Click Deploy.
    Vercel will build your app and give you a live URL like https://your-project-name.vercel.app.